<!--
  Static for now: only routes that render something meaningful to a signed-out
  visitor. Regenerate at build time once per-book aggregate and archetype pages
  land — those are the ones actually worth crawling.

  Not listed, deliberately:
    /echoes         authed-only (nested under the app layout); a crawler gets
                    the landing page, not an echo feed.
    /reset-password inert without a token from an email, so there is nothing
                    to index and nothing a searcher could want.
    /s/, /u/        reader surfaces, disallowed in robots.txt.
-->
